cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite Qanary using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Qanary: Sweep and measurement utilities for QCoDeS"
abstract: >-
  Qanary runs parameter sweeps and records measurements with QCoDeS
  instruments, storing each measurement as an xarray dataset with its
  metadata. It can stream running measurements to Qimchi for live plotting.
